        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "6C635DB24E47D098012F6081DD0A67B6",
        "SourceString": "Lord Ashbourne has invited me to his castle. Obviously something feels off about that, so I better consult with my allies.",
        "LocalizedString": "Lord Ashbourne has invited me to his castle. Obviously something feels off about that, so I better consult with my allies."
      },
      "CompletionText": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "FF96C6AD4CBC1A564605CF849A12FAFD",
        "SourceString": "After defeating Ashbourne, a mix of triumph and urgency filled the air. The Butcher revealed that my father was alive, hidden somewhere in Karvenia, igniting a fire of determination within me. As I pressed for answers, I knew I had to balance my quest for reunion with the looming threats that still surrounded us, vowing to stay vigilant until I could find him.",
        "LocalizedString": "After defeating Ashbourne, a mix of triumph and urgency filled the air. The Butcher revealed that my father was alive, hidden somewhere in Karvenia, igniting a fire of determination within me. As I pressed for answers, I knew I had to balance my quest for reunion with the looming threats that still surrounded us, vowing to stay vigilant until I could find him."
